<title>USA: Suarro Comm to trade on OTC Bulletin Board.</title>
<headline>Suarro Comm to trade on OTC Bulletin Board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suarro Communicaitions Inc said the NASD has given the company clearance for the quotation of its common stock on the OTC Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>Suarro Communications is a value added consolidation company whose targets are small communications companies offering ancillary telecommunication products and services to end users.</p>
